  "body": [
    "We design the experiences of tomorrow, that make businesses future-proof.",
    "Spark Reply's approach helps complex organisations in architecting intent-driven human-agent collaboration across the employee and customer experience.",
    "Interpret and anticipate tomorrow’s needs to identify new opportunities and challenge the status quo.",
    "Growth strategyExperience strategyInnovation strategyCustomer research",
    "Support in seizing whole new market opportunities through disruptive experiences: from concept to launch.",
    "Business modellingProduct strategyConcept to launch design and dev.Go to market strategy",
    "Re-imagine or enhance the product / service portfolio to meet the expectations of an ever demanding customer base.",
    "Next-generation experience designService designUX/UIDigital product developmentCustomer validationProduct management",
    "Support in creating and scaling high-performing, design and product management teams for maximum impact.",
    "DesignOpsProduct managementCX management",
    "With the ‘COOL’ feature, the automotive group helps customers identify the ideal moment for especially green charging and uses playful incentives to encourage climate-friendly behaviour.",
    "We supported Unipol, a leading Insurance company in Italy, in designing a new mobile-first website to launch their new venture in car glass repair and replacement.",
    "Discover also"
